    "summary_short": "Im Dong-hwan assists a film crew in creating a documentary about his blind father, a renowned stamp engraver celebrated for his craftsmanship. The production takes a disturbing turn when authorities notify Dong-hwan that the remains of his mother, who vanished forty years prior, have finally been found. Accompanied by the documentary journalist, Dong-hwan launches an inquiry into her mysterious past and disappearance. As they retrace old steps, Dong-hwan uncovers buried family trauma and sinister secrets that shatter his understanding of his childhood.",
